{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":36,"creatorName":"Yann LeCun","creatorHandle":"ylecun","lane":"AI research","phase1Followers":1287400,"authorHandle":"ylecun","authorUserId":"48008938","authorName":"Yann LeCun","authorFollowersObserved":1288526,"authorFollowingObserved":794,"authorPostsObserved":27208,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_search_timeline_main_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T20:38:38.239Z","id":"2083290542956224643","postType":"quote","text":"Tired of not winning","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":20,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1785530145000,"postedAt":"2026-07-31T20:35:45.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":816.0481219444445,"url":"https://x.com/ylecun/status/2083290542956224643","views":203226,"likes":649,"reposts":40,"replies":55,"bookmarks":25,"quotes":7,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"2083008924370800680","quotedPost":{"id":"2083008924370800680","authorHandle":"RpsAgainstTrump","authorName":"Republicans against Trump","authorFollowersObserved":1028862,"text":"Donald Trump “erupted” during a meeting with his top national security team last week, reportedly yelling expletives at those present, according to NBC News.\n\nThe report says Trump is “exasperated” by the lack of progress in ending the Iran war and the lack of a clear strategy.\n\nOne Trump ally said, “The president is exasperated. I don’t think he believed it was going to be this difficult to get the Iranians to agree to a deal.”","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2026-07-31T01:56:42.000Z","views":363775,"likes":1346,"reposts":396,"replies":229,"bookmarks":65,"quotes":54,"media":[{"id":"2083008920436572160","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HOhVk66XgAAUTdd.jpg","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/RpsAgainstTrump/status/2083008924370800680/photo/1","altText":null,"width":2048,"height":